{"id":"conferencia","lemma":"conferencia","pos":"noun","rank":1850,"glosses":["conference","meeting","lecture"],"ipa":"/konfeˈɾenθja/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"conferencias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bc/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-conferencia.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Tendré que dar una conferencia?","en":"Will I have to give a lecture?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/702945","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to give, to give out"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"La conferencia está abierta al público.","en":"The conference is open to the public.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/845784","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"the act of opening"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"public"}]},{"text":"La conferencia se terminó a las cinco.","en":"The conference ended at five.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/937692","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to finish","l":"terminar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"a five"}]},{"text":"Sus conferencias son muy largas.","en":"His lectures are very long.","words":[{"g":"his, her, its, their"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"long","l":"largo"}]},{"text":"Su conferencia empezó a tiempo.","en":"His lecture started on time.","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},null,{"g":"to start","l":"empezar"},null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"in time"]]}]}